            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> My lua config sets line numbers on.\r\n\r\nYes, mine too. 'mini.starter' only disables number column for when the Starter buffer is shown in the window. Otherwise it should use global value of `number`.\r\n\r\nDo you have any reproducible steps to see that `number` is not shown after picking some item in Starter buffer?",
            "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">My lua config sets line numbers on.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, mine too. 'mini.starter' only disables number column for when the Starter buffer is shown in the window. Otherwise it should use global value of <code class=\"notranslate\">number</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Do you have any reproducible steps to see that <code class=\"notranslate\">number</code> is not shown after picking some item in Starter buffer?</p>",
            "bodyText": "My lua config sets line numbers on.\n\nYes, mine too. 'mini.starter' only disables number column for when the Starter buffer is shown in the window. Otherwise it should use global value of number.\nDo you have any reproducible steps to see that number is not shown after picking some item in Starter buffer?",
